EO:11935,FRDOC:2011-16272,2011-16272,Proposed Rule,2011-06-30,76 FR 38326,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2011/06/30/2011-16272.txt,e500cab48cb497b14ba32021a493808aa58feac7d237ebe7292a3bb338e359fc,"Under Executive Order 11935, only U.S. citizens or persons who owe permanent allegiance to the United States are eligible for appointment to competitive service positions."
