EO:11935,FRDOC:2026-13154,2026-13154,Rule,2026-06-30,91 FR 39361,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2026/06/30/2026-13154.txt,62b0d9dd08d920f13f419ec1727e4eb546f13b62f7d58c53d2a317b58a949399,"As explained in Executive Order 11935, an individual cannot be admitted to competitive examination or given an appointment in the competitive service unless he or she is a citizen or national of the United States."
