EO:12072,EO:14091,2023-03779,Presidential Document,2023-02-22,88 FR 10825,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,True,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2023/02/22/2023-03779.txt,23cb3ac3cff08fd4ef3e9c63da5e3d17601fd3ba74d0ad388bfeb038dd5c6fb5,"(c) Executive Order 13946 of August 24, 2020 (Targeting Opportunity Zones and Other Distressed Communities for Federal Site Locations), including the amendments it made to Executive Order 12072 of August 16, 1978 (Federal Space Management), and to Executive Order 13006 of May 21, 1996 (Locating Federal Facilities on Historic Properties in Our Nation's Central Cities), is revoked."
