EO:12549,FRDOC:2021-27447,2021-27447,Notice,2021-12-20,86 FR 71868,suspension,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2021/12/20/2021-27447.txt,6e6eadfed1827b8a9c85017b6328c9d907316e1273cb2ab058dc19362fc32e09,"(ii) Additional eligibility requirements you must meet are as follows: (a) An applicant is not eligible if they have been debarred or suspended or otherwise excluded from or ineligible for participation in Federal assistance programs under Executive Order 12549, ``Debarment and Suspension.'' The Agency will check the System for Award Management (SAM) at the time of application and prior to funding"
