EO:12856,FRDOC:97-7495,97-7495,Notice,1997-03-26,62 FR 14430,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1997/03/26/97-7495.txt,fb32116e722cf1a89cda3bca4936b3b2ed61c6a72643a53b74fce83c0d3da47c,"The training course will also address the EPCRA and PPA reporting requirements as they apply to Federal agencies as a result of Presidential Executive Order 12856, ``Federal Compliance with Right-to-Know Laws and Pollution Prevention Requirements.'' The course focuses on the EPCRA Section 313 Toxic Chemical Release Inventory (TRI) reporting requirements."
