EO:12931,FRDOC:2018-25443,2018-25443,Rule,2018-11-29,83 FR 61309,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2018/11/29/2018-25443.txt,1bcf85bab313cd891984e26d7310c1cc4ade4432894e9370fc16955816dd2a43,"(5) Pursuant to Executive Order 12931, ``Federal Procurement Reform,'' and 41 U.S.C. 1702(c), serve as the Senior Procurement Executive for the Department with responsibility for the following: (i) Prescribing and publishing Departmental acquisition policies, advisories, regulations, and procedures."
