EO:13087,EO:13086,98-14688,Presidential Document,1998-06-02,63 FR 30065,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/06/02/98-14688.txt,52082b3ea257a56864daede09c4cda2b61c1cf03b3389d1a6e64d307310475a3,"Executive Order 13087--Further Amendment to Executive Order 11478, Equal Employment Opportunity in the Federal Government ␀ ␀ ␀ Presidential Documents ␀ ␀"
EO:13087,FRDOC:98-24752,98-24752,Proposed Rule,1998-09-18,63 FR 50024,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/09/18/98-24752.txt,81dc6aad79d87dabecc9ef86429abb22b02d478a4a06a612b67a5db433a14126,"In order to be consistent with the principle of Executive Order 13087 (May 28, 1998), 63 FR 30097 (June 2, 1998), as well as to promote comity with laws and policies of neighboring jurisdictions, the Trust has added the category of ``sexual orientation'' to the list of prohibited bases for discrimination under this section."
EO:13087,FRDOC:98-28699,98-28699,Proposed Rule,1998-11-10,63 FR 62962,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/11/10/98-28699.txt,d34762d5a24318dd9c21dd717b042787e8342650a50c00bf48a7b718eb3f4c14,"Based on this policy and Executive Order 13087 in which the President directed a uniform policy prohibiting discrimination on this basis in Federal employment, USDA is about to add sexual orientation as a protected class to its complaint process for USDA employees."
EO:13087,FRDOC:99-11477,99-11477,Presidential Document,1999-05-05,64 FR 24279,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1999/05/05/99-11477.txt,740ecd6ce34d924850f338679bb32a3ac677244eb3cb336ac3362421f17c1575,"In May of 1998, I was proud to sign Executive Order 13087, which amends Federal equal employment opportunity policy to prohibit discrimination based on sexual orientation in the Federal civilian work force."
