EO:13087,FRDOC:E6-21733,E6-21733,Notice,2006-12-20,71 FR 76340,cross_reference,mention,False,False,True,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2006/12/20/E6-21733.txt,60acbf9010fa9701172d8db15d176a7dbac59d5e972867340e6cff7834967e14,"Although not covered by the No Fear Act, discrimination on the basis of sexual orientation is prohibited by Executive Order 11478, as amended by Executive Order 13087."
