EO:13526,FRDOC:2019-11369,2019-11369,Presidential Document,2019-05-29,84 FR 24971,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,True,2,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2019/05/29/2019-11369.txt,42bd8fc9e548c55b448b8f377ac0ecc47e1123df59d0afe39d485ad57ab816a9,"With respect to any matter classified under Executive Order 13526 of December 29, 2009 (Classified National Security Information), the Attorney General may, by applying the standard set forth in either section 3.1(a) or section 3.1(d) of Executive Order 13526, declassify, downgrade, or direct the declassification or downgrading of information or intelligence that relates to the Attorney General's "
