EO:13526,EO:14040,2021-19578,Presidential Document,2021-09-09,86 FR 50439,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,True,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2021/09/09/2021-19578.txt,85647f299c9f6bf3acec07d3bc556b790c972a65da9285e62eea09d74cd6bd30,"(a) Consistent with Executive Order 13526 of December 29, 2009 (Classified National Security Information), the Attorney General or the head of any other agency that originated the information, as the case may be, shall be responsible for conducting the declassification reviews and making declassification determinations for information that originated within their respective agency."
