EO:13672,FRDOC:2014-21945,2014-21945,Proposed Rule,2014-09-17,79 FR 55712,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,6,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2014/09/17/2014-21945.txt,58a68160bbe13555ed081484830a281afe6d578cb9d64bc696232f86a0d7d042,"\48\ On July 21, 2014, the President signed Executive Order 13672 amending Executive Order 11246 to include nondiscrimination based on sexual orientation and gender identity."
EO:13672,FRDOC:2014-28723,2014-28723,Notice,2014-12-08,79 FR 72703,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2014/12/08/2014-28723.txt,2b473c10b3c9d7114cab76cea0b3d7f2a47ddf52aba0b77015176bb01cef63fe,"SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION: I. Background: On July 21, 2014 President Obama issued Executive Order 13672, titled ``Further Amendments to Executive Order 11478, Equal Employment Opportunity in the Federal Government and Executive Order 11246, Equal Employment Opportunity.'' Executive Order 13672 amends Executive Order 11246 and directs DOL to prepare regulations to implement its requirements."
EO:13672,FRDOC:2014-28902,2014-28902,Rule,2014-12-09,79 FR 72985,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,26,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2014/12/09/2014-28902.txt,afd7eb745d0414eb5291a4e3d1e06dffe67d2d6df4cf72cc5a688a556b01890e,"EO 13672 amended EO 11246, which previously only prohibited discrimination by Federal contractors and subcontractors on the bases of race, color, religion, sex, and national origin and required them to take affirmative measures to prevent discrimination on those bases from occurring."
